<title>USA: American Eco to buy Chempower.</title>
<headline>American Eco to buy Chempower.</headline>
<dateline>AKRON, Ohio 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chempower Inc and American Eco Corp said Wednesday they had entered into an agreement for American Eco to acquire Chempower for $6.20 cash per share.</p>
<p>Chempower has about 7.8 million outstanding shares.</p>
<p>The agreement has been approved by the Chempower and Houston-based American Eco boards and is expected to be submitted to Chempower shareholders for their approval at a special meeting in November, the two companies said.</p>
</text>
